WEBVTT

00:02.890 --> 00:05.200
This is so boring, Mob.

00:02.890 --> 00:08.730
Ura Sunday

00:05.730 --> 00:08.730
Doesn't that just mean
no one's being bothered by spirits?

00:09.010 --> 00:10.980
I hate this.

00:10.980 --> 00:12.280
It's really peaceful.

00:13.040 --> 00:14.780
But we need food on our table!

00:15.120 --> 00:17.940
We have to make a move.

00:15.770 --> 00:18.990
You don't know what true fear is

00:15.770 --> 00:18.990
Urban Legends

00:15.770 --> 00:18.990
Enter

01:39.280 --> 01:44.120
Mob Psycho

01:49.000 --> 01:54.000
Urban Legends
~Encountering Rumors~

01:55.550 --> 01:56.710
Urban legends?

01:56.710 --> 02:01.580
Yeah. Surely you've discussed some
with friends at some point.

02:01.580 --> 02:03.080
I haven't, actually.

02:03.080 --> 02:06.930
Really? They were super popular
when I was a kid.

02:08.030 --> 02:10.400
Like Hanako-san in the bathroom
or the human-faced dog...

02:10.400 --> 02:13.210
Or, if you want something newer, the Dragger.

02:13.600 --> 02:18.830
We'll look up sighting reports online
and follow these urban legends.

02:18.830 --> 02:21.800
So it's like when we went
to find the tsuchinoko?

02:21.800 --> 02:22.570
Not quite.

02:22.870 --> 02:27.030
The Dragger is completely made up.
She doesn't exist.

02:28.030 --> 02:29.000
Then, why...

02:29.380 --> 02:31.520
Places where urban legends are popular

02:31.520 --> 02:34.710
tend to have a lot of people
who easily believe in the supernatural.

02:34.710 --> 02:38.920
Meaning they're gold mines
for exorcism jobs.

02:39.430 --> 02:41.550
You're so excited about
this Schadenfreude search.

02:41.940 --> 02:44.470
The key to successful
walk-in sales is a smile!

02:44.470 --> 02:45.550
Spiritual Advice

02:46.930 --> 02:51.390
Spiritual Advice

02:48.340 --> 02:50.170
That table is really low.

02:50.170 --> 02:51.390
I didn't think this through.

02:51.690 --> 02:53.670
Those are some cold stares...

02:54.260 --> 02:56.550
Uh, we might be bothering the pedestrians.

02:56.550 --> 02:57.800
Hey, you two.

02:58.390 --> 03:00.570
Who said you could
conduct your business here?

03:01.260 --> 03:03.560
You dare set up shop here knowing that I,

03:03.110 --> 03:07.240
Rising Sun Spiritual Union
Shinra Banshomaru

03:03.560 --> 03:06.850
Shinra Banshomaru, the greatest psychic
of this century, hold jurisdiction here?

03:07.240 --> 03:09.740
He's the "greatest of this century," too?

03:09.740 --> 03:11.260
What do you mean, jurisdiction?

03:11.650 --> 03:14.490
You're not a member of
the Rising Sun Spiritual Union?

03:14.850 --> 03:18.230
I'm a freelancer.
The name's Reigen Arataka.

03:18.230 --> 03:21.820
If you're also running a
spirit con—business,

03:21.820 --> 03:23.850
could you introduce me to some clients?

03:23.850 --> 03:25.470
I haven't had too many lately.

03:26.460 --> 03:30.200
I'm not about to help a business rival.

03:30.200 --> 03:31.470
Begone at once!

03:31.470 --> 03:32.850
I respectfully decline.

03:32.850 --> 03:34.610
What authority do you have?

03:33.600 --> 03:36.480
Free psychic readings

03:34.610 --> 03:36.480
This is clearly a traffic violation.

03:36.480 --> 03:39.330
You guys have no right to bring up the law.

03:39.750 --> 03:41.790
And what do you mean by that?

03:42.440 --> 03:43.950
Um...

03:44.370 --> 03:46.850
Are you psychics?

03:46.850 --> 03:48.020
Yes?

03:48.020 --> 03:50.370
I'd like to discuss something with you.

03:50.980 --> 03:52.790
Happy to help you out, ma'am!

03:50.980 --> 03:52.790
But of course!

03:54.170 --> 03:55.830
So what did you want to discuss?

03:56.090 --> 03:58.970
I've always been susceptible to spirits.

03:58.970 --> 04:02.300
I often attract ghosts and other
strange phenomena near me.

04:02.570 --> 04:05.590
Even as we speak,
there's something next to me...

04:05.880 --> 04:07.200
Next to you? I don't—

04:07.200 --> 04:08.600
There definitely is. I see it.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.610
Hey, stop making things up.

04:10.610 --> 04:11.920
What did you say, you swine?

04:12.300 --> 04:17.340
Give me a break. Fakes like you
make my job so much harder.

04:17.340 --> 04:18.310
Right, Mob?

04:18.580 --> 04:20.920
It's the spirit of a middle-aged man.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.270
Let's get back on track.

04:22.270 --> 04:25.450
Thank goodness. You're actual psychics.

04:25.450 --> 04:29.240
When I asked about it on the internet,
all I got was irresponsible advice.

04:30.140 --> 04:31.700
What are you writing?

04:31.700 --> 04:33.870
I can't believe I never thought
about a website.

04:33.870 --> 04:35.210
I'll make one as soon as I'm home.

04:35.210 --> 04:39.290
And lately, I've been feeling
a really bad aura.

04:39.720 --> 04:43.800
I've only been able to get by thanks to
having a plate of salt in my apartment.

04:43.990 --> 04:48.270
I see. Textbooks confirm
the effectiveness of piles of salt.

04:48.270 --> 04:51.560
Indeed. Even as we speak,
the sodium from this pile of French fries

04:51.560 --> 04:52.970
is mitigating the negative effects.

04:53.380 --> 04:55.820
Mob, don't eat too many of those.

04:56.850 --> 05:00.780
But then I realized that the reason
this eerie feeling has gotten worse lately

05:00.780 --> 05:04.390
is because of the sudden spread of
urban legends around this city.

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
Cuticle City Urban Legends

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
Human-Faced Dog

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
It's said that the vengeful spirit of a middle-aged
man who committed suicide possessed a dog.
It rummages through the trash downtown,
and if you call it, it'll say, "Just leave me alone."

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
Dash Granny

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
When you're driving on the freeway in the
middle of the night, you might hear a tapping
on your window. You'll then see a granny
running alongside your car at the same speed.
Apparently, if she outruns you, you'll get into a car accident.

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
The Red Raincoat

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
It wanders endlessly through the city in the rain,
dressed in all red. If someone sees the red raincoat,
they will die. However, if you're wearing something
red, your life will be spared.

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
The Dragger

05:04.940 --> 05:10.780
Dressed in torn white clothing, the Dragger drags
people around until they are but lumps of meat.
When she was human, she suffered from horrible bullying,
and from that hatred, she'll capture children and drag them around.

05:05.130 --> 05:08.870
Human-Faced Dog, Dash Granny,
the Red Raincoat,

05:08.870 --> 05:10.380
and of course... the Dragger.

05:10.980 --> 05:14.410
Please, eliminate all
of these urban legends.

05:14.700 --> 05:18.120
Come on... Who would take
such an impossible request?

05:18.910 --> 05:21.610
Please leave it to me, Reigen Arataka!

05:21.610 --> 05:24.110
I'll make sure they're wiped off
the face of this earth!

05:25.220 --> 05:27.940
So, which course would you like to go with?

05:27.940 --> 05:28.760
"Course"?

05:28.760 --> 05:30.590
I recommend this weekend combo deal...

05:31.670 --> 05:34.680
I must say, I was surprised
you accepted a request like that.

05:35.100 --> 05:37.390
And 20,000 yen if the request works out?

05:37.750 --> 05:39.660
You'd ask for about that much, wouldn't you?

05:39.660 --> 05:42.550
I generally start at 200,000.

05:42.920 --> 05:46.640
If I actually took on this request,
it'd be more than 500,000—

05:45.590 --> 05:48.360
Well, you'll still be helping me with this.

05:48.360 --> 05:51.070
I'm sorry? What did he just say?

05:51.070 --> 05:54.640
Let's get going. If we keep wasting time,
the sun's gonna go down.

05:54.640 --> 05:56.790
Um... Shinrin Maruo, was it?

05:56.790 --> 06:00.070
It's Shinra Banshomaru,
and I'm not going to help you!

05:56.910 --> 06:02.500
Shinra Banshomaru

06:00.070 --> 06:02.500
You heard her out with me,
so don't you dare run away.

06:02.500 --> 06:04.180
That makes no sense.

06:04.180 --> 06:05.900
I'll make sure you get your cut.

06:06.410 --> 06:08.590
Let's split up and do some investigating.

06:08.590 --> 06:11.550
New Star of the Psychic World

06:08.830 --> 06:11.550
Let's remember the three Cs:
contact, communicate, and consult.

06:12.990 --> 06:13.880
Oh, fine.

06:14.080 --> 06:16.800
I'll consider this charity work
and help you out.

06:16.800 --> 06:18.780
Yeah, I'm counting on you.

06:19.190 --> 06:20.830
Like you have anything better to do.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.770
Mob, is Dimple around?

06:23.020 --> 06:25.050
Dimple, you're being summoned.

06:25.420 --> 06:26.230
What do you want?

06:26.920 --> 06:30.210
I'm making myself less visible
because I'm sick of talking to you.

06:30.210 --> 06:33.070
Come on, don't be like that.
We're work buddies.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.640
How?!

06:34.640 --> 06:36.300
You just order me around—

06:36.300 --> 06:39.450
Tail that chubster using
that stealth mode of yours.

06:39.450 --> 06:41.280
Why should I?

06:41.280 --> 06:42.910
If he runs off, just let him go.

06:43.330 --> 06:46.380
Nah, I bet he's a super serious moron
that does everything by the book.

06:46.380 --> 06:49.690
Meaning, if something were to happen to him,

06:49.690 --> 06:51.340
it'd be my fault for making him do this.

06:51.550 --> 06:54.550
Please, Dimple.
It'd be better to avoid any accidents.

06:54.550 --> 07:01.180
Watch out for suspicious people

06:55.230 --> 06:56.650
Oh, fine.

06:56.650 --> 06:58.180
This is give and take.

06:58.180 --> 07:01.660
You're going to have to listen to one
of my demands sometime soon, Shigeo!

07:02.360 --> 07:03.520
What's the matter, Mob?

07:03.800 --> 07:08.970
Well, it's like the client said.
Something's weird about this town.

07:09.570 --> 07:12.520
There might actually be something here.

07:17.070 --> 07:19.290
Why did we come to an internet café?

07:19.290 --> 07:23.160
If I go around questioning kids,
people might think I'm someone suspicious.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
Cuticle Middle School Dark Messageboard

07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
Make sure you keep posting! (^o^)/

07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
2950. Another crappy day~

07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
Name: Student A  Date: 9/28 (Fri) 16:43

07:23.160 --> 07:24.120
My teacher is so frickin' annoying.
Who do they think they are, bossing me around every day?
Totally ignoring them.

07:24.140 --> 07:26.930
Wow. It's all just a bunch of complaints.

07:25.290 --> 07:27.960
Someone was sucking up to the math teacher today.
It was so gross.
Do people seriously enjoy doing that?

07:25.290 --> 07:27.960
2953. Hey, did you see?

07:25.290 --> 07:27.960
Name: Student A  Date: 9/28 (Fri) 16:16

07:25.290 --> 07:27.960
The old guy with the bad eyes who lives on Fourth
has a human-faced dog lololol

07:25.290 --> 07:27.960
\h\h\h2954. Re: Hey, did you see?
Name: Student D  Date: 9/28 (Fri) 16:23
For real? Should go check it out sometime, lol

07:26.930 --> 07:30.630
There must be something useful
within this barrage of complaints...

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
\h\h\h\h2955. Re: Re: Hey, did you see?
Name: Student E  Date: 9/28 (Fri) 16:26
I wanna go, too lolol

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
2956. This is scary

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
Name: Student C  Date: 9/23 (Sun) 17:12

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
Did you hear that the dash granny showed up in OO Tunnel?

07:29.630 --> 07:30.630
2957. Re: This is scary
I've heard of her, but I don't know anyone who's seen her

07:30.630 --> 07:31.760
Hey, look!

07:31.760 --> 07:33.970
Cuticle Park

07:32.090 --> 07:33.520
Sighting report!

07:34.250 --> 07:37.090
We saw an old guy in red earlier.

07:37.090 --> 07:39.180
He tried to talk to us, so we ran away.

07:39.180 --> 07:40.970
What? When?!

07:41.360 --> 07:43.320
Wh-Where? Where was he?!

07:43.320 --> 07:45.390
Hey, that hurts! Let go!

07:45.620 --> 07:47.520
Why's this guy breathing so heavily?

07:47.520 --> 07:49.480
O-Oh, I'm sorry. I just got a bit excited...

07:49.760 --> 07:52.190
Uh, wait, I didn't mean excited
in that kind of way...

07:53.410 --> 07:55.030
Why are you looking at me like that?

07:55.320 --> 07:56.410
We're leaving now.

07:56.710 --> 07:57.240
Hey!

07:57.550 --> 07:59.030
You mustn't go alone! You're girls!

07:59.300 --> 08:00.400
Get away from us!

08:00.400 --> 08:01.750
This guy's a pervert!

08:03.660 --> 08:05.480
Hey, stop that!

08:05.480 --> 08:06.540
I'm not—

08:06.850 --> 08:08.540
Huh? What?

08:06.920 --> 08:07.290
Stare

08:07.790 --> 08:08.540
Stare

08:08.540 --> 08:10.770
N-No! I'm not a pervert!

08:10.770 --> 08:13.890
I'm an extremely well-known psychic!

08:14.580 --> 08:15.920
Did he just say psychic?

08:15.920 --> 08:17.760
Like that doesn't sound shady...

08:17.760 --> 08:18.260
Ow!

08:18.260 --> 08:20.330
Hey, don't throw rocks at me!

08:20.330 --> 08:20.850
Ow!

08:21.100 --> 08:22.560
That guy was so gross.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.190
Wait! I need that lead!

08:24.190 --> 08:26.840
Crap! The girls I was after!

08:28.400 --> 08:29.390
Wait, was that...

08:30.190 --> 08:31.690
Hold it right there!

08:33.810 --> 08:36.280
You must be the Red Raincoat!

08:36.280 --> 08:37.450
Don't get in my way!

08:38.970 --> 08:41.850
There's nothing fun about
exposing myself to another guy!

08:41.850 --> 08:43.850
So you're a flasher who goes after children?

08:43.850 --> 08:45.370
You filthy criminal!

08:46.410 --> 08:49.040
This is awesome! Creep versus creep!

08:49.040 --> 08:50.800
Get a video of this!

08:53.780 --> 08:57.370
I may not look it, but I was vice captain
of the sumo club in grade school!

08:57.370 --> 08:58.250
I give up!

08:58.250 --> 09:00.660
I give up, so let me go!

09:01.120 --> 09:02.470
You got me...

09:02.760 --> 09:04.670
Or so you thought...

09:04.670 --> 09:07.960
I was on the track team
in middle school, fatty!

09:08.930 --> 09:10.460
Talk about playing dirty.

09:10.460 --> 09:11.900
But damn, he's fast.

09:11.900 --> 09:13.150
Terror

09:13.910 --> 09:15.820
This is the human-faced dog?

09:15.820 --> 09:19.310
That looks like marker.
I guess the sighting report was fake.

09:19.310 --> 09:22.230
No, this is definitely the human-faced dog.

09:22.230 --> 09:23.530
What do you mean?

09:23.750 --> 09:26.930
This is usually how rumors go.

09:26.930 --> 09:30.500
To grade and middle school kids,
this is the real deal.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.890
Hey, someone's at our
human-faced dog's house.

09:33.890 --> 09:35.340
We should charge admission.

09:35.570 --> 09:37.850
Whose dog is this?

09:37.850 --> 09:39.760
The old guy who lives here.

09:39.760 --> 09:42.740
His eyes are bad, so he hasn't noticed
we scribbled on its face.

09:42.740 --> 09:45.200
A-Are you his grandkids?

09:45.200 --> 09:46.680
Huh? What gave you that idea?

09:46.680 --> 09:48.620
Hey, you little shits!

09:48.620 --> 09:51.650
I'll kick your asses the next time
you try to draw on this dog's face!

09:52.120 --> 09:54.510
So he says after he actually hit us.

09:54.510 --> 09:56.110
We're gonna tell the PTA on you.

09:56.110 --> 09:58.150
Yeah, just try it.

09:58.150 --> 10:02.530
You know what this world needs?
Adults who can keep you little shits in line!

10:02.910 --> 10:06.950
Don't think that I, Suzuki Taro, am going
to be a pushover like your teachers.

10:07.260 --> 10:09.920
But you use a fake name anyway?

10:10.770 --> 10:13.130
You'll give Terror a bath?

10:13.130 --> 10:14.670
What a nice young man.

10:14.670 --> 10:19.090
Was he that dirty? Then, I guess
I'll take you up on your offer.

10:19.090 --> 10:20.710
Here, Terror.

10:21.940 --> 10:24.730
Look at him happily wag his tail
with his ominous-sounding name.

10:25.870 --> 10:26.510
Now, then...

10:26.830 --> 10:30.930
We'll need before and after pictures
for our progress report.

10:31.290 --> 10:33.570
I wonder if he just likes dogs.

10:33.570 --> 10:36.230
Did you know it was just
a prank to begin with?

10:36.480 --> 10:37.630
Of course I did.

10:37.630 --> 10:40.760
Were you actually looking for
a dog with a person's face?

10:41.790 --> 10:43.350
There, there.

10:42.200 --> 10:47.160
Dog Shampoo

10:42.200 --> 10:47.160
Dirt-be-gone

10:42.200 --> 10:47.160
Boney Bones

10:42.200 --> 10:47.160
Nom

10:43.350 --> 10:45.650
Let's see if we can get
some hot water for him.

10:51.590 --> 10:53.120
What? You outta breath?

10:53.600 --> 10:56.790
Too bad for you. I may have been
in the sumo club in grade school,

10:56.790 --> 10:59.090
but in middle school,
I was on the table tennis team!

10:59.470 --> 11:01.960
I'm plenty confident about my stamina!

11:01.960 --> 11:04.350
You're so out of breath, though.

11:04.350 --> 11:08.310
Why are you chasing me?
This has nothing to do with you.

11:08.660 --> 11:10.830
Ever heard of citizen's arrest?

11:10.830 --> 11:13.920
Even a civilian can arrest
a criminal in the act.

11:13.920 --> 11:17.120
Let the blades of justice
strike you down, you pervert!

11:17.120 --> 11:19.030
You seriously thought you caught me?

11:19.890 --> 11:21.610
I led you here on purpose!

11:26.590 --> 11:30.310
I will admit, this all started
as an unusual fetish.

11:30.310 --> 11:35.330
But before long, I started finding pleasure
in rumors of me spreading around town.

11:35.890 --> 11:38.140
I felt like some kind of celebrity!

11:38.140 --> 11:42.760
Just by wearing this raincoat,
I feel unstoppable!

11:43.290 --> 11:46.720
You wanna turn me in to the police?

11:46.720 --> 11:49.680
I'd love to see you try!

11:54.970 --> 11:56.360
He passed out.

11:56.870 --> 12:01.170
But he and others saw my face, which will
make things harder for me in this town.

12:01.540 --> 12:02.810
Guess it's time to leave.

12:10.990 --> 12:14.450
No Trespassing

12:21.690 --> 12:24.590
Who the hell are you?
Did you see everything?

12:25.460 --> 12:28.050
Hey, aren't you thirsty?

12:29.040 --> 12:31.260
What, it's just some crazy bitch?

12:35.930 --> 12:38.900
Hey, aren't you thirsty?

12:39.670 --> 12:40.360
Yeah...

12:41.570 --> 12:43.190
Never been thirstier!

12:43.480 --> 12:46.110
I'll let you drink until you explode, then!

13:07.090 --> 13:10.090
Spirit Hold

13:07.280 --> 13:10.090
Spirit Hold! There, now you can't move!

13:13.060 --> 13:15.770
Damn it! I've not recovered from being tased!

13:19.880 --> 13:20.480
Wha—

13:22.570 --> 13:23.690
Where'd she go?!

13:35.460 --> 13:38.960
II

13:35.460 --> 13:38.960
Mob Psycho
100

13:38.960 --> 13:42.460
II

13:38.960 --> 13:42.460
Mob Psycho
100

13:56.970 --> 13:59.230
Guess Reigen was right
to send me as insurance!

14:01.680 --> 14:05.160
Talk about pressure...
Her aura's stabbing me left and right.

14:05.950 --> 14:10.120
Guess I'll try to drag out all
of this guy's latent powers.

14:10.590 --> 14:13.080
Hey, aren't you thirsty?!

14:13.300 --> 14:14.790
You tryin' to hit on me?

14:14.790 --> 14:17.050
I'm not a fan of forceful girls!

14:23.730 --> 14:24.510
Take that!

14:31.190 --> 14:33.430
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

14:38.180 --> 14:41.820
To think his manual would
save him this way...

14:39.110 --> 14:41.820
Spiritual Worldism
for Psychics

14:49.440 --> 14:50.580
His life comes first...

14:50.880 --> 14:52.780
I'll happily turn tail and run away!

14:54.450 --> 14:55.560
I need to send an SOS!

14:57.090 --> 14:58.960
There, all clean.

14:59.190 --> 15:02.670
Mob, how did you get that wet?

15:02.670 --> 15:04.550
I shouldn't have helped.

15:05.590 --> 15:07.130
Hello, this is Reigen.

15:07.130 --> 15:09.100
Hey, did you get any info...

15:12.230 --> 15:13.060
Let's go.

15:13.310 --> 15:15.030
The Dragger showed up.

15:22.450 --> 15:25.280
No wonder she's trending
in the urban legends world.

15:26.160 --> 15:31.850
Maybe because she's all over social media,
she's got way more energy fueling her.

15:41.260 --> 15:44.040
And now she's going for function over form.

16:09.880 --> 16:11.490
His Achilles tendon just snapped!

16:11.850 --> 16:14.250
You damn fatty... You need to exercise more.

16:23.270 --> 16:24.710
Please, Dimple.

16:25.340 --> 16:29.590
If I let this guy die,
Shigeo will lose faith in me.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.820
And I can't let that happen!

16:33.210 --> 16:35.830
He's going to be even bigger someday.

16:36.340 --> 16:38.980
I can't mess up at a place like this.

16:40.070 --> 16:41.460
Oh, shit.

16:52.050 --> 16:53.690
Thanks, Dimple.

16:55.410 --> 16:57.810
Wow, so that's the Dragger?

16:57.810 --> 16:58.920
Is that actually her?

16:58.920 --> 17:00.870
I need to get a photo for proof.

17:01.090 --> 17:01.630
Huh?

17:02.650 --> 17:04.250
She's not showing up on my screen.

17:04.970 --> 17:05.630
She ran!

17:06.850 --> 17:09.890
That's a monster born from rumors.

17:09.890 --> 17:13.160
You can't classify her as real or fake.

17:13.160 --> 17:13.970
What do you mean?

17:14.610 --> 17:16.790
The imagination of the masses,

17:16.790 --> 17:20.270
and their fear and curiosity,
is what gave birth to her.

17:20.700 --> 17:23.980
Her looks and her strength
was all decided by humans!

17:24.430 --> 17:27.000
So you're saying their imagination
became reality?

17:27.440 --> 17:29.180
Th-That's right...

17:29.180 --> 17:32.200
And since we know about the Dragger,
we won't be able to exorcise her.

17:32.200 --> 17:33.680
Huh? Why?

17:33.680 --> 17:37.650
Wasn't there a time as a kid when you
were frightened by rumors about her?

17:38.660 --> 17:40.460
True...

17:41.390 --> 17:44.000
The Dragger would appear before kids
heading home from school,

17:44.000 --> 17:46.460
snatching them up and
dragging them into the bog...

17:47.460 --> 17:49.870
I didn't believe in Santa Claus,

17:49.870 --> 17:52.790
but thinking about her on rainy days
as I passed street corners

17:52.790 --> 17:54.390
would give me goosebumps, too.

17:56.350 --> 18:00.280
That fear is still burned into our brains.

18:00.280 --> 18:02.810
We're even trembling as we speak.

18:02.980 --> 18:07.150
So I'm breaking out in a cold sweat
because I'm scared deep down?

18:07.350 --> 18:12.350
Powers used in fear only empower its source.

18:12.730 --> 18:14.860
My spiritual powers did nothing.

18:15.090 --> 18:18.570
She grows by absorbing the powers
of those who fear her.

18:19.530 --> 18:21.460
Attacking her is futile.

18:22.020 --> 18:23.950
Then we have no choice but to run.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.790
Mob, temporary retreat...

18:26.920 --> 18:28.540
Wh-What is this?!

18:28.540 --> 18:29.580
I'm stuck!

18:29.580 --> 18:32.150
This must be her doing.

18:35.820 --> 18:37.160
She's huge!

18:35.820 --> 18:37.160
What?!

18:44.730 --> 18:48.640
Didn't you hear him, Mob?
Your powers will be absorbed, too!

18:48.980 --> 18:50.530
Wait, hang on a sec...

18:51.580 --> 18:53.000
It's actually working!

18:55.680 --> 18:58.410
I see... Shigeo...

18:58.410 --> 19:04.370
He's detached from urban legends, fads,
and other hot topics among people.

19:04.630 --> 19:07.600
He's completely out of the loop!

19:08.060 --> 19:11.880
So he has no idea
what makes the Dragger so scary!

19:20.060 --> 19:22.060
It's a ghost that appears
on rainy days, right?

19:22.870 --> 19:24.770
It's not exactly not scary.

19:24.770 --> 19:26.370
You don't get it!

19:26.370 --> 19:29.160
The Dragger has a grip strength
of 500 kilograms!

19:29.160 --> 19:30.730
Once she grabs you, you can't escape!

19:31.040 --> 19:33.110
And she can swim 100 meters in 20 seconds!

19:33.110 --> 19:35.690
Oh, so that's the kind of character she is.

19:36.120 --> 19:40.190
What, you think she's some
kind of OC or something?

19:40.190 --> 19:43.430
You should at least pretend to be
scared or shocked by these things.

19:43.430 --> 19:45.780
This is why nobody clues you in.

19:45.780 --> 19:49.520
But you used to say that
I didn't have to be like others.

19:49.520 --> 19:53.060
Lip service gains importance
as you grow up.

19:55.820 --> 19:58.630
I got injured while I was unconscious?

19:59.040 --> 20:02.100
Anyway, thanks.
That was a valuable experience.

20:02.370 --> 20:05.440
I'm going to the police now to
talk to them about the flasher.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.980
Guess this is goodbye.

20:06.980 --> 20:08.420
Ow!

20:08.420 --> 20:09.890
Yeah, take care.

20:11.840 --> 20:16.110
Well, I guess we should check out
Dash Granny before we leave.

20:23.300 --> 20:25.530
Looks like we got here at the perfect time.

20:28.710 --> 20:30.800
Keep your guard up.

20:38.690 --> 20:40.640
There she is! She actually showed up!

20:40.640 --> 20:41.930
Mob! Exorcise her!

20:46.860 --> 20:49.190
Huh? One more time...

20:51.930 --> 20:52.750
Huh?

20:52.750 --> 20:53.980
What's wrong, Shigeo?

20:53.510 --> 20:55.240
She's coming! Hey!

20:55.500 --> 20:58.600
Oh, no... I can't exorcise her...

20:58.600 --> 21:02.240
The Dragger doesn't even compare...
She's too powerful.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.620
What?!

21:04.100 --> 21:06.080
Hey, come on now...

21:06.220 --> 21:07.290
What do we do?

21:07.290 --> 21:09.370
There's only one thing we can do! Get away!

21:09.370 --> 21:10.200
Run!

21:10.200 --> 21:11.790
Hey, what happens if she catches up?

21:12.800 --> 21:16.290
Apparently, she jumps on your back
and strangles you to death!

21:18.750 --> 21:21.130
Run! Run! She's catching up!

21:21.290 --> 21:22.850
Step on it, Mob!

21:38.910 --> 21:41.530
Turns out she was just
some old lady running...

21:41.860 --> 21:46.140
Couldn't you have used your powers
to teleport or something?

21:46.770 --> 21:48.250
Why are you crying?

21:48.960 --> 21:52.700
Scraped
his face

21:49.430 --> 21:52.700
Because... I run every day...

21:53.040 --> 21:54.920
But that old lady beat me!

21:54.920 --> 21:57.170
Ding...

21:57.940 --> 21:59.800
It's not a competition, man.

21:59.800 --> 22:02.170
Well, I got that old lady's picture,

22:02.550 --> 22:04.680
so I guess our work here's done.

22:05.420 --> 22:11.100
Dash Granny would become Mob's first
traumatic experience with urban legends.

22:11.140 --> 22:14.150
Some days later

22:11.140 --> 22:14.150
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

22:12.830 --> 22:14.140
It's finally done!

22:14.140 --> 22:15.420
Take a look, Mob.

22:15.850 --> 22:17.770
Now we'll get even more jobs!

22:19.880 --> 22:21.020
What is this?

22:21.020 --> 22:24.990
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

22:21.020 --> 22:24.990
The star psychic of the 21st century
who defeated the Dragger

22:21.020 --> 22:24.990
Welcome to
Reigen Arataka's
homepage!

22:21.020 --> 22:24.990
You're the number

22:21.020 --> 22:24.990
visitor to this page.

22:21.890 --> 22:22.990
It's shady as hell!

23:55.840 --> 23:59.330
Yes! I'm getting one job after another
because of my webpage!

23:59.330 --> 24:01.540
But wait, Mob's been acting a bit weird.

24:01.710 --> 24:02.790
What's wrong, Mob?

24:03.060 --> 24:05.440
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 3:

24:05.440 --> 24:07.210
"One Danger After Another
~Degeneration~."

24:07.210 --> 24:10.050
Recording it? That's also a wise decision.

24:07.210 --> 24:10.210
One Danger After Another
~Degeneration~
